# retry with 0 retries and a always-failing thunk exhausts immediately.
# retry-impl with n=0: tries once, fails, n < 1 → raises "retry limit exceeded".
# try captures the raised error as Variant(Error, ...).
[result: [try [fn [] [retry 0 [fn [] [raise "always fail"]]]]]]
=== out
Dict({"result": Variant(Error, String("retry limit exceeded"))})
